# build output
/build/
/build/logs/
obj/

# ★★ GROUND TRUTH IS LOCAL AND NEVER PUSHED (CLAUDE.md §2.2).
# docs/ground-truth/ holds the GIME reference and the AGI Specifications. They are
# third-party documents that live in the working tree and are not ours to redistribute.
# The .gitkeep is tracked (negated below) so the directory exists on a fresh clone and
# a citation like [ref: GIME-RM §10] has a home to point at.
#
# ★ CONSEQUENCE, and it is the reason this is a rule and not a convenience: a citation
# against a file in here is EXECUTOR-VERIFIABLE AND ORCHESTRATOR-UNVERIFIABLE. Absence
# from the public repo is NOT absence from the working tree (CLAUDE.md §2S.2).
docs/ground-truth/*
!docs/ground-truth/.gitkeep

# ★ GAME DATA IS THE USER'S AND IS NEVER COMMITTED (CLAUDE.md §2P).
# games/ holds MANIFESTS ONLY — checksums and version identification. VOL and DIR files
# are copyrighted, are the user's property, and are read-only to this project. A game
# file that reaches the index is a bug, not an oversight.
games/**
!games/manifests/
!games/manifests/.gitkeep
!games/manifests/*.md
!games/manifests/*.json
!games/manifests/*.tsv

# ★ THE ORACLE IS PINNED, NOT VENDORED (CLAUDE.md §2Q.1).
# oracle/ holds oracle/scummvm.pin, patches and dumps. A checked-in ScummVM tree starts
# feeling like source, and per CLAUDE.md §2 there is no source. Never vendor it.
oracle/scummvm/
oracle/src/
oracle/**/*.o
oracle/**/*.so
oracle/**/*.exe

# disk images and build artifacts — reproducible from tools/imgbuild/, never committed
*.dmk
*.dsk
*.jvc
*.vhd
*.bin
!content/*.bin

# python / logs / previews
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
harness/**/previews/
/build/previews/

# MAME writes cfg/ (coco3.cfg, default.cfg) into its CWD, which is the repo root when
# harness/smoke/run_*_test.sh runs. Emulator state, not project state.
/cfg/

# MAME writes snap/ (screenshots) into its CWD, same as cfg/.
/snap/

# MAME rewrites files in -cfg_directory on exit and drops a default.cfg there.
# The authored coco3.cfg templates are tracked; MAME's byproducts are not.
dist/mame-cfg/*/default.cfg

# git checkout-index --temp scratch (used by the .gitattributes CRLF round-trip check)
.merge_file_*
